@backendUrl = http://127.0.0.1:7289
@aiUrl = http://localhost:8001
@candidateEmail = candidate@gmail.com
@candidatePassword = 111111Aa@
@serviceToken = hr-connect-local-secret
@cvFilePath = C:\Users\truon\Downloads\CV.pdf

# MF-03 background E2E test.
# Prerequisites:
# 1. HR Connect and ai-service are both running.
# 2. The seeded ACTIVE Job exists and this Candidate has not applied to it.
# 3. serviceToken matches HRCONNECT_SERVICE_TOKEN in both processes.
# 4. cvFilePath points to a real PDF on this machine.
# Run TC-00 through TC-05 in order. Re-run TC-05 until COMPLETED or FAILED.

### TC-00 - AI health; expect HTTP 200
GET {{aiUrl}}/health

### TC-00B - AI integration readiness; expect HTTP 200
GET {{aiUrl}}/ready

### TC-01 - Candidate login; expect HTTP 200
# @name candidateLogin
POST {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{candidateEmail}}",
  "password": "{{candidatePassword}}"
}

### TC-01B - Find the seeded ACTIVE Job; expect items[0].jobId
# @name activeJobs
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?search=%5BSEED%5D%20Junior%20.NET%20Backend%20Developer&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### TC-02 - Submit a new PDF CV; expect HTTP 200 and aiStatus=PENDING
# @name candidateApply
POST {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{activeJobs.response.body.$.items[0].jobId}}/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MF03Boundary

--MF03Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="CV.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< {{cvFilePath}}
--MF03Boundary--

### TC-03 - Verify HR Connect can issue a temporary CV URL; expect HTTP 200
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/internal/cvs/{{candidateApply.response.body.$.data.cvId}}/download-url
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

### TC-04 - Verify MF-03 can read the Job/JD contract; expect HTTP 200
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/internal/jobs/{{activeJobs.response.body.$.items[0].jobId}}/jd
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

### TC-05 - Read latest AI result
# First response may be PENDING or PROCESSING.
# Re-run only this request after a few seconds until status is COMPLETED or FAILED.
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/internal/ai-results/{{candidateApply.response.body.$.data.applicationId}}
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

### TC-06 - Negative security check; expect HTTP 403
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/v1/internal/ai-results/{{candidateApply.response.body.$.data.applicationId}}
X-Service-Token: wrong-secret
